# Frontend Architecture

## Mục tiêu

Frontend Architecture là cách tổ chức và design frontend applications để đảm bảo scalability, maintainability, và performance. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, frontend architecture được hướng dẫn với focus trên component design, state management, routing, và user experience. Mục tiêu của rule này là cung cấp framework cho việc build robust frontend applications.

Frontend applications ngày càng phức tạp với business logic moved client-side. Good architecture giúp manage complexity và improve developer productivity.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Component Architecture**

Atomic design principles. Reusable components. Composable patterns. Clear component hierarchy.

**2. State Management**

Single source of truth. Predictable state updates. Separation of concerns. State vs UI state.

**3. Routing**

Client-side routing. Lazy loading. Nested routes. Route guards.

**4. Data Fetching**

Server state vs client state. Caching strategies. Optimistic updates. Error handling.

**5. Performance**

Code splitting. Lazy loading. Memoization. Virtual scrolling. Image optimization.

**6. Accessibility**

Semantic HTML. ARIA attributes. Keyboard navigation. Screen reader support.

**7. Testing**

Component testing. Integration testing. E2E testing. Visual regression.

**8. Error Handling**

Error boundaries. Graceful degradation. User feedback. Recovery strategies.

**9. Security**

XSS prevention. CSRF protection. Content Security Policy. Input validation.

**10. Documentation**

Component documentation. Design tokens. Style guides. API documentation.

